name conversation_outage_user_turn
describe User <-> AI conversation, audio, 100 ms RTT; the user-to-AI link is down for 2 s during the user's second turn (#757)
call two-way
video off
duration 30s
at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=50ms queue=300ms
at 10.5s down
at 12.5s up
reverse at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=50ms queue=300ms
turn user 1s-4s
turn ai after=800ms len=4s
turn user 10s-13s
turn ai after=800ms len=4s
turn user 19s-22s
turn ai after=800ms len=4s
# program.md 6.3, conversation sev:1: the AI hears the user and the user hears the AI's replies, through and after the
# outage. The outage is beyond the sev:2 conditions (<= 5% loss), so no delay line.
expect conv.responses >= 3
